                    // marshals a receiver for `invoke_kind` `0 | 1 | 2`,
                    // and the helper screens the receiver itself.
                    // Not while the raw `ScopedMemoryAccess` fold is on: the
                    // `session()` it feeds is `segment != null ? .. : null`, a
